    stAbreLaVersionWebEnEl:'Open the web version in the phone browser to connect Puter AI. The app keeps working with symbolic readings, system voice, avatar, PDFs and the local library.', stLaSesionWebYLosDatos:'The web session and the app’s local data stay separate.', stIosPuedeMantenerElMismoNombre:'iOS may keep the same name even when it uses the downloaded enhanced version. Safari decides which voices it exposes to web pages.', stNoHayErroresRegistrados:'No errors recorded.', stOraculoMisticoReuneTarotRunasLuna:'Oráculo Místico brings together tarot, runes, moon, dreams, numerology and a journal in one symbolic app.', stIncluyeLaAppCompletaManualPolitica:'Includes the full app, manual, privacy policy and release notes. Fill in the legal details before sharing it.', stUsaElBotonInstalarDeLa:'Use the Install button in the address bar.', stCompartirAnadirAPantallaDeInicio:'Share → Add to Home Screen.', stLaInstalacionDependeDelSistemaTambien:'Installing depends on the system; you can also save a shortcut.', stPruebaTarotRunasOElMensaje:'Try Tarot, Runes or the daily message.', stConservaTusLecturasEnLaBiblioteca:'Keep your readings in the local Library.', stAjustaVozTemaYPrivacidad:'Adjust voice, theme and privacy.', stConectaPuterSoloSiQuieresAmpliar:'Connect Puter only if you want to extend a reading.', stCorreccionesDeFirefoxArranqueMigracionEstabilidad:'Fixes for Firefox, startup, migration, stability and restored internal panels.', stLasLecturasElPerfilYEl:'Readings, profile and chat stay in this browser. When you use Puter AI, the text you send is processed by that service.', stFormulaTuPreguntaYPulsaComenzar:'Ask your question and press start. The cards will appear with the ceremony you set.', stTodaviaNoHayReflexiones:'No reflections yet.', stFavoritas:'Favourites', stMarcaLecturasComoFavoritasDesdeBiblioteca:'Mark readings as favourites from the Library.', stUltimasLecturas:'Latest readings', stTodaviaNoHayLecturasGuardadas:'No saved readings yet.', stEli