    aiConnected:'AI: connected',
    rn0U:'Fehu: wealth, prosperity, material abundance. It invites you to enjoy what you have harvested. In love: generous bonds. At work: financial success.', rn0R:'Reversed: losses, poor management, selfishness.', rn1U:'Uruz: vital strength, health, power. Raw energy to get past obstacles. In love: intense passion. Work: determination.', rn1R:'Reversed: weakness, exhaustion.', rn2U:'Thurisaz: protection, necessary conflict, defence. It is the rune of Thor hammer.', rn2R:'Reversed: vulnerability, betrayal.', rn3U:'Ansuz: communication, wisdom, counsel. Important messages, learning.', rn3R:'Reversed: misunderstandings, deceit.', rn4U:'Raidho: travel, movement, evolution. Changes of place or of perspective.', rn4R:'Reversed: delays, standstill.', rn5U:'Kenaz: knowledge, creativity, passion. A light that reaches into the dark.', rn5R:'Reversed: darkness, creative block.', rn6U:'Gebo: gift, partnership, generosity. Balance in the exchange.', rn7U:'Wunjo: joy, harmony, wellbeing. Happiness that is shared.', rn7R:'Reversed: sadness, discord.', rn8U:'Hagalaz: disruptive change, necessary chaos. A force of nature.', rn9U:'Nauthiz: need, endurance, learning through difficulty.', rn9R:'Reversed: restriction, self-pity.', rn10U:'Isa: stillness, freezing, introspection. Everything comes to a halt.', rn11U:'Jera: harvest, results, cycles. Reward after the effort.', rn12U:'Eihwaz: endurance, spiritual connection, initiation. A bridge between worlds.', rn12R:'Reversed: confusion, weakness.', rn13U:'Perthro: mystery, fate, revelation. The unknown.', rn13R:'Reversed: secrets, ill fortune.', rn14U:'Algiz: protection, defence, opportunity. A shield against harm.', rn14R:'Reversed: vulnerability, danger.', rn15U:'Sowilo: sun, success, energy, clarity. It lights your path.', rn16U:'Tiwaz: victory, justice, sacrifice. Honour and leadership.', rn16R:'Reversed: defeat, injustice.', rn17U:'Berkano: growth, fertility, new beginnings. The rune of mother earth.', rn17R:'Reversed: stagnation.', rn18U:'Ehwaz: progress, trust, teamwork. Smooth movement.', rn18R:'Reversed: obstacles.', rn19U:'Mannaz: humanity, community, mutual help. Your place in the group.', rn19R:'Reversed: isolation, selfishness.', rn20U:'Laguz: intuition, flow, emotional healing. Let yourself be carried.', rn20R:'Reversed: confusion, fear of change.', rn21U:'Ingwaz: potential, gestation, achievement. Something is forming.', rn22U:'Dagaz: day, awakening, transformation, hope. A turn toward the light.', rn23U:'Othala: inheritance, home, tradition. What comes to you from those before.', rn23R:'Reversed: loss, uprooting.',
